**Describe the solution you'd like**

@joyeecheung points out in https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/31132 that we might do better to pull in [Chromium's SourceMap implementation](https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/devtools-frontend/src/front_end/sdk/SourceMap.js), which seems to have evolved beyond the version pulled into V8.

I suggest that we swap out `source_map.js` for this class, when I have the time to port it.
